## WS02 — `data` block and outcome semantics

### Implemented Changes (by area/file)

**Schema & Compiler (`workflow/`):**
- `workflow/schema.go`: Replaced `SharedVariableSpec`/`SharedVariableNode` with `DataSpec`/`DataNode`/`DataRef`. Added `WriteSpec`/`CompiledWrite`. Changed `OutcomeSpec.Next` from `string` to `hcl.Expression`. Updated `FSMGraph` to use `Data map[string]map[string]*DataNode` and `DataOrder []DataRef`.
- `workflow/compile_data.go` (new): Compiles `data "internal" "name"` blocks; rejects unsupported kinds; checks name collisions against variables/locals/duplicates; resolves `write { target = data.<kind>.<name>.value, value = ... }` targets; validates write output references.
- `workflow/compile_steps_graph.go`: Wired `resolveNextAttr` for every outcome; replaced `SharedWrites` handling with `Writes`; carried over aggregate-iteration write rule.
- `workflow/compile_switches.go`: Extended `resolveNextAttr` to accept bare `return`/`continue` keywords and two-segment traversals.
- `workflow/eval.go`: Replaced flat `shared.*` namespace with nested `data.internal.<name>.value` + `.type` in eval context.
- `workflow/parse_legacy_reject.go`: Added legacy rejection for `shared_variable` blocks, `shared_writes` attribute, and string-form `next = "..."`.
- Deleted: `workflow/compile_shared_variables.go`, `workflow/compile_shared_variables_test.go`.

**Engine Runtime (`internal/engine/`):**
- `internal/engine/data_store.go` (new): Renamed from `shared_var_store.go`; keyed by `(kind, name)`; `SetBatch` preserves atomicity.
- `internal/engine/node_step.go`: Replaced `applySharedWrites` with `applyDataWrites`.
- Updated `parallel_iteration.go`, `while_iteration.go`, `engine.go`, `runstate.go`, and other engine files to use `DataStore`.
- Deleted: `internal/engine/shared_var_store.go`, `internal/engine/shared_var_subworkflow_test.go`.

**CLI & Examples & Docs:**
- Migrated all `.hcl` files under `examples/`, `.criteria/workflows/`, `internal/cli/testdata/`, `internal/engine/testdata/`, `workflow/testdata/` from legacy syntax.
- Updated `docs/workflow.md`, `docs/LANGUAGE-SPEC.md`, and all `docs/llm/*.md` to use `data "internal"` / `write { }` / traversal `next` terminology.
- Updated `tools/spec-gen/render.go` to generate correct spec tables.

